{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17831","headline":"见薛侍御戴不损裹帽子因赠 · 杨巨源","name":"见薛侍御戴不损裹帽子因赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"潘郎对青镜，乌帽似新裁。\n晓露鸦初洗，春荷叶半开。\n堪将护巾栉，不独隔尘埃。\n已见笼蝉翼，无因映鹿胎。\n何人呈巧思，好手自西来。\n有意怜衰丑，烦君致一枚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨巨源","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}